                    <img src="file:///C:/Proyek/App Book Finder/Review Kitab/Etalase 2/3 Fathul Bari Syarah Shahih Al-Bukhari - Ibnu Rajab Al-Hanbali - Dar Ibnu Al-Jauzi (1430 H) Samping.jpg" width="300" height="200" style="display:inline-block;">
                    
                    <div class="review-body" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 20px;"><p>awajhابسsja a </p></div>
                </body>
                </html>